Copyright 2026 dxmsk contributors

The JavaScript adapter was written for Venera. Its Madara protocol handling,
CSS selectors, and chapter protector algorithm were informed by the
Apache-2.0-licensed Keiyoushi extensions-source project:
https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source
Relevant paths: src/zh/bakamh and lib-multisrc/madara.
Copyright remains with the respective upstream contributors.

Venera interfaces were checked against venera-app/venera-configs and
venera-app/venera. These projects are referenced for compatibility; their
runtime or source files are not bundled here.

Offline tests use synthetic HTML and synthetic encrypted image URLs only.
